purpose: Golden fixture for internal/normalize. Parsed by the COEX adapter into a
  sources.ParsedEvent, then normalized to a model.Event; the test asserts the
  full normalized struct (dates parsed to ISO, classification, missing_fields,
  templated summary). Chosen because it is a real industry event (digital-health)
  with a complete When/Where/주최/homepage set and absent action fields, so it
  exercises both the happy path and the actions.* missing_fields honesty rule.
